                <pb facs="0768" n="650" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg650"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.51/1285: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Judah</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-06-02T10:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 2, 1928—10
                                a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:10 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>81. For White. Official decree accepting Chase Bank’s bid for $50,000,000
                    financiering issued last night.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Judah</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
